flowchart TB
  accTitle: Cancellation acknowledgment and settlement
  accDescr: Evaluate current cancellation guards. Refusal has no new effect. Acceptance releases the seat and records a refund obligation. Later the refund is settled or needs attention. A local timeout changes observer knowledge rather than provider state.
  G["Evaluate current guards"] -->|fail| F["Refused\nNo new effect"]
  G -->|pass| A["Seat released\nRefund pending"]
  A -->|acknowledge| R["Receipt:\nrelease + obligation"]
  R --> S["Later: settled"]
  R --> H["Later: needs attention"]
  classDef pending fill:#FFFBEB,stroke:#92400E,color:#111827;
  classDef success fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#166534,color:#111827;
  classDef refusal fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#991B1B,color:#111827;
  class A,R,H pending;
  class S success;
  class F refusal;
